  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 (net10.0) instead of .NET 9. Projects on .NET 8 or 9 should stay on 1.0.0.3.\n\t\t\tNo public API changes since 1.0.0.3.\n\t\t\tDependency changes: Microsoft.Extensions packages 9.0.7 to 10.0.13 and Xeption 2.8.0 to 2.9.0. FluentAssertions is now pinned to exactly 7.2.2 (it was 7.2.0 or later). GoogleReCaptcha moves NHSISL.CsvHelperClient from 1.1.0 to 3.1.0.\n\t\t\tThe package license changes from MIT to Apache 2.0.",
